{"id":"664ee3b20b491cf3","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-set10-hereditary-transitive-closure.md","title":"ZFC Set10 Hereditary Transitive Closure","display":"df-zfc-set10-hereditary-transitive-closure — ZFC Set10 Hereditary Transitive Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set10-hereditary-transitive-closure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set10-hereditary-transitive-closure"],"display":"df-zfc-set10-hereditary-transitive-closure — ZFC Set10 Hereditary Transitive Closure","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-transitive-closure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set10-hereditary-transitive-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set10-hereditary-transitive-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set10-hereditary-transitive-closure — ZFC Set10 Hereditary Transitive Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"58-df-transitive-closure\">58-df-transitive-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,x\\in V\">\\(H,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"58-df-transitive-closure\">58-df-transitive-closure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10HereditaryTransitiveClosure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet10HereditaryTransitiveClosure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}hereditary\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet10HereditaryTransitiveClosure}_S(H,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S(H,\\{x\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}hereditary\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet10HereditaryTransitiveClosure}_S(H,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S(H,\\{x\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The singleton input makes the closure contain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> itself, not merely every member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive-closure","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transitive-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive-closure","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-transitive-closure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10HereditaryTransitiveClosure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}hereditary\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet10HereditaryTransitiveClosure}_S(H,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CanonicalTransitiveClosure}_S(H,\\{x\\})","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":976,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3383","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-set10-hereditary-transitive-closure.md|58-df-zfc-set10-hereditary-transitive-closure]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","8c8abfb908cc9a24"]}